{"4836170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cell Conquest", "steam_appid": 4836170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cell Conquest</strong> is a turn-based logic strategy game about walls, cells, and smart tactical decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place walls on the board, plan your moves carefully, and try to capture more cells than your opponents. When a cell already has three walls, placing the fourth wall conquers it for you. Every move can open a chance for your rival - or create a chain of captures for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in <strong>Single Player</strong> mode against the computer, or switch to <strong>Local Multiplayer</strong> and compete with friends on the same device. Multiplayer supports <strong>2 to 5 players</strong>, making each match a different tactical challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>6 different maps</strong> and <strong>6 board sizes</strong> to create quick simple matches or larger battles that require deeper planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based logic strategy gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player mode against the computer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer for 2–5 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different maps / game fields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 board sizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical wall placement and cell capture mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules with strategic depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good for training attention, planning, calculation, and tactical thinking</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is about reading the board, predicting the next move, and deciding when to give up a small cell to win a bigger area later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build walls. Capture cells. Outsmart your rivals.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cell Conquest</strong> is a turn-based logic strategy game about walls, cells, and smart tactical decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place walls on the board, plan your moves carefully, and try to capture more cells than your opponents. When a cell already has three walls, placing the fourth wall conquers it for you. Every move can open a chance for your rival - or create a chain of captures for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in <strong>Single Player</strong> mode against the computer, or switch to <strong>Local Multiplayer</strong> and compete with friends on the same device. Multiplayer supports <strong>2 to 5 players</strong>, making each match a different tactical challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>6 different maps</strong> and <strong>6 board sizes</strong> to create quick simple matches or larger battles that require deeper planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based logic strategy gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player mode against the computer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer for 2–5 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different maps / game fields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 board sizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical wall placement and cell capture mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules with strategic depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good for training attention, planning, calculation, and tactical thinking</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is about reading the board, predicting the next move, and deciding when to give up a small cell to win a bigger area later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build walls. Capture cells. Outsmart your rivals.</p>", "short_description": "Cell Conq